### One day, a little bird could not fly. It
  -> One day, a little bird could not fly. It was sad because it was hungry. The bird sat on a branch and started to cry. A kind squirrel saw the bird and wanted to help. / "Hello, bird," said the squirrel. "Why are you sad?" The bird told the squirrel about its hungry wing and the red berry bush. The squirrel had an idea and ran to find some food. / The squirrel came back with a big piece of bread. It gave the bread to the bird. The bird ate the bread and felt better. It could fly again! The bird and the squirrel became best friends and played together in the forest every day.
